  "historyNote": "#13323, eff 1-5-22; ss by #13324, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 1-5-22, EXPIRED: 7-4-22; reverted back to #13323; ss by #13436, eff 8-18-22; ss by #14592, eff 6-1-26, EXPIRES: 6-1-36",
